  "title": "Fitfit Spiced Breakfast Roast",
  "image": "generated://dishcovery/9001026.jpg",
  "readyInMinutes": 45,
  "servings": 4,
  "summary": "Adapted into a hearty morning dish, this Ethiopian recipe showcases a <b>breakfast beef roast</b> infused with aromatic spiced butter known as niter kibbeh. Tender beef cubes are tossed with berbere spice and roasted at high heat until deeply browned and fragrant. The roasted meat and its pan juices are then simmered with onions, garlic, and tomato before shredded torn injera bread is folded into the pan. The spongy sourdough injera absorbs the spicy berbere-infused gravy like a sponge, creating a rich texturally unique breakfast classic. Soft-boiled eggs and fresh jalapeno slices are layered over the warm mixture right before serving. Packed with <b>protein, iron, and essential minerals</b>, this flavorful roast delivers a powerful boost of morning energy. The contrast between tender beef, tangy fermented bread, and hot spiced butter makes this an unforgettable breakfast experience. Enjoy with a hot cup of dark spiced Ethiopian coffee for a complete morning ritual.",
